#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When &konqueror; connects to a web site to retrieve information, some basic "
"identifying information is sent to the web site in the form of a <quote>User "
"Agent</quote> header."
msgstr ""
"Kada se &konqueror;  povazuje sa web stranicama da dobije informacije, neke "
"osnovne informacije se salju web sajtu u obliku <quote>Korisnicki agent</"
"quote> napadač."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Because of minor differences in the way that different web browsers "
"function, web sites that rely too much on a single browser may sometimes not "
"display as intended when viewed using another browser. Some web sites are "
"smart enough to examine the contents of the user agent header and "
"incorporate this information in the &HTML; code so that the content is "
"displayed correctly regardless of the browser used."
msgstr ""
"Zbog male razlike u načinu na koji različite web stranice funkcionisu, web "
"stranice koje su bazirane previše na jednom pretraživaču, ne prikazuju ono "
"sto treba kad koriste drugi pretraživač.Neke stranice su dovoljno pametne da "
"ispitaju sadržaju zaglavlja korisničkog agenta i ukljuce sve informacije u "
"&HTML; kod tako da se sadrzaj prikazuje ispravno bez obzira koji se "
"pretrazivac koristi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"However, you may find that some web sites refuse to function correctly "
"unless you are using a browser recognized as <quote>proper</quote> by that "
"site. In these cases, you may find it necessary to fool the web site by "
"having &konqueror; report itself to be another browser by means of the user "
"agent header."
msgstr ""
"Međutim, mozda cete pronaći da neke web stranice odbijaju funkcionisati ako "
"ne korsite pretrazivac poznat kao <quote>odgovarajuci</quote> od te "
"stranice. U tim slucajevima,moze se dasiti da je potrebno prevariti web "
"stranicu koristenjem &konqueror;  izvještaja da se prijavi kao drugi "
"pretrazivac putem zaglavlja korisničkog agenta."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Use</title>"
msgstr "<title>Upotreba</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this module you can configure the type of browser that &konqueror; will "
"report itself to be. You can control this information by web site. Usually, "
"the list box that is labeled <guilabel>Site Specific Identification</"
"guilabel> will be empty, so that &konqueror; will always use its default "
"useragent string."
msgstr ""
"U ovom modulu mozete podesiti vrstu pretrazivaca koji ce &konqueror; biti. "
"Mozete konrolisati tu informaciju putem web stranice. Obicno, u okviru sa "
"popisom <guilabel>Site Specific Identification</guilabel> koji je prazan se "
"korisiti podrazumjevani niz korisnickih agenata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can disable the sending of a user agent entirely, by unchecking the "
"<guilabel>Send identification</guilabel> check box. This may cause strange "
"behavior on some sites, and may even deny you access to some websites, so "
"disable this with caution."
msgstr ""
"Možete onemogućiti slanje korisničkih agaenata  u potpunosti, ako poništite "
"<guilabel>Pošalji identifikaciju</guilabel> kućicu za potvrdu. To može "
"izazvati čudno ponašanje nekih sajtova, uskratiti pristup na neke web "
"stranice tako da je isključite s oprezom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To configure a new agent binding, press the <guibutton>New...</guibutton> "
"button. Type the name of the server or a domain in the text box at the top "
"of the dialog that pops up, which is labeled <guilabel>When browsing the "
"following site</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Da biste konfigurisali novog agenta pritisnite <guibutton>New...</"
"guibutton>  dugme.Upišite naziv poslužitelja ili domene u okvir za tekst na "
"vrhu dijaloga koji se pojavljuje, koja je označena kao <guilabel> Kada "
"pretražujete sljedeći sajt</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that you can <emphasis>not</emphasis> use the wildcard character "
"<token>*</token> in this text box. However, the string <userinput>kde.org</"
"userinput> will match all hosts in the domain <systemitem>kde.org</"
"systemitem>"
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da možete <emphasis> ne </emphasis> koristiti džokera <token> "
"* </token> u ovom polju za tekst. Međutim, string <userinput> kde.org </"
"userinput> će odgovarati svim domaćima u domeni <systemitem> kde.org </"
"systemitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After typing the name of the server, type in the identifying string in the "
"next combo box, which is labeled <guilabel>Use the following identification:"
"</guilabel>, or choose a string from the list. If you don't choose a string "
"from the list, you will need to know what a valid string from the browser "
"looks like. For example, you could type <userinput>Mozilla/4.0 (compatible; "
"MSIE 4.0)</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Nakon upisivanja imena servera, unesite identifikacijski string u sljedeći "
"combo box koji je oznacen kao <guilabel>Koristite  sljedeće identifikacije:</"
"guilabel>, ili izaberite string iz liste. Ako ne izaberete string iz liste, "
"trebate znati kako validan string  pretraživača izgleda.Na primjer, možete "
"ukucati <userinput>Mozilla/4.0 (compatible; MSIE 4.0)</userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can click on an existing entry in the list, and then modify the contents "
"of the text boxes, followed by clicking <guibutton>Change...</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Možete kliknuti na postojeće stavke na listi, a zatim mijenjati sadržaj "
"teksta kutije, klikom na<guibutton> Izmijeni... </guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button can be used to delete the selected "
"entry in the list of configured agent bindings. The <guibutton>Delete All</"
"guibutton> will remove all the configured user agent strings. Click the "
"<guibutton>Apply</guibutton> to take your changes in effect."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton> Izbrisi </guibutton> može se koristiti za brisanje odabranog "
"unosa u povezanoj konfigurisanoj  listi konfiguriran agenata. <guibutton> "
"Izbriši sve </guibutton> će ukloniti sve konfiguririsane korisnicke agente "
"iz liste. Kliknite na <guibutton>Primjeni </guibutton> da primjenite  vaše "
"promjene."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can use the check boxes at the top of the screen to build a user agent "
"that is uniquely yours, by choosing your own combination of operating system "
"name and version, platform, processor type, and language."
msgstr ""
"Mozete se koristiti poljima kućicama na vrhu ekrana da naravite korisnički "
"agent koji je samo vaš, biranjem svoje kombinacije imena i verzije "
"operativnog sistema, platforme, tipa procesora i jezika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In all cases, the user agent that is being sent by default is displayed in "
"bold text at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"U svim slucajevima korisnicki agent koji se salje kao podrazumjevani se "
"prikazuje boldiranim slovima na vrhu stranice."
